      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is Dr. Everett Fox’s English translation of the Ḳaddish d’Rabanan, “in the spirit of Franz Rosenzweig.” Franz Rosenzweig did make several translations of Jewish liturgy including a German translation of the Kaddish d’Rabbanan, “Das Lernkaddisch,” published in 1921. I have set Dr. Fox’s translation side-by-side with the Aramaic text of the Ḳaddish. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_38483_notes"/>
